            "title": "BofA cuts FrontView REIT to Underperform after second CFO fired in two months",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "BofA downgraded FrontView REIT (FVR) to Underperform from Neutral with a price target of $11, down from $15, after the company announced the appointment of Sean Fukumura as Interim Chief Financial Officer, effective immediately, following the the board\u2019s decision to terminate Randall Starr for cause. It will be challenging for management to focus on financing and executing its growth plans given the loss of one of the company\u2019s key members and the firm thinks a discount multiple relative to peer",
